                    title:                  `Brand Builder`,
                    subtitle:               `You lead the relaunch of Cordillera Verde, a Costa Rican coffee that sources 100% certified-sustainable beans — and whose customers have no idea. Build the positioning, choose the campaign claims, allocate a ₡480M media budget across channels, and prove brand equity moved without breaking the 18% margin floor.`,
