                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the board & a skeptical journalist)`,
                    coach_intro:            `You are sitting on the category's best sustainability story — 100% certified sourcing, a real farmer premium — and your customers have never heard it. The rival out-marketed you on your own ground with a thinner story. Make sustainability the meaning of the brand, claim the truth without overclaiming past it, and spend the ₡480M where equity actually converts — all without breaching the 18% margin floor. Reach without conversion is vanity; a bold claim you can't prove is the next greenwashing headline.`,

