                    r2_pct:                 `%`,
                    r2_boldness_hint:       `Bolder than your evidence raises greenwashing risk (a complaint, a journalist, a credibility collapse); far below your evidence wastes the real 100%-certified story.`,
                    claim_specific:         `Specific & verified — "100% sourced from certified Tarrazú cooperatives, farmer premium paid" with the evidence to back every word`,
                    claim_broad:            `Broad & bold — "the planet's most sustainable coffee", move perception fast and worry about proof later`,
                    claim_timid:            `Cautious & vague — say "responsibly made" and avoid any number you'd have to defend`,
                    claim_generic:          `Mostly taste & premium — keep sustainability as a small line so nobody can challenge it`,
                    mech_traceability:      `Farmer traceability + third-party certification + annual impact report — fully substantiated`,
                    mech_cert:              `Certification logo on pack only — let the seal do the talking`,
                    mech_story:             `Emotional farmer storytelling, no hard certification shown`,
                    mech_none:              `No proof mechanism — trust the creative to sell the feeling`,

