                    kpi_honest:             `Honest accounting — report what CRC 480M actually moved, flag the slowest KPI, show the margin held the floor`,
                    kpi_inflated:           `Claim it all — awareness +20, equity +18, top sustainability perception AND positive ROI to impress the board`,
                    kpi_vanity:             `Lead with awareness only — it's the number that moved most; keep the others quiet`,
